OL,3,A'Stop throwing shade' - the woman
OL,4,Atrying to stop firms leaving the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK needs to do more to back its own
OL,7,Fcompanies at a time when a growing
OL,8,Fnumber are choosing to list their
OL,9,Fshares in the US rather than at home,
OL,10,Fthe boss of the London Stock Exchange
OL,11,F(LSE) has told the BBC.
OL,13,FDame Julia Hoggett said the government
OL,14,Fneeded to make it "more attractive" to
OL,15,Finvest in the UK stock market,
OL,16,Fotherwise big firms would continue to
OL,17,Flook overseas for their next stage of
OL,18,Fgrowth.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
