OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Stop throwing shade' - the woman
OL,4,Atrying to stop firms leaving the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the last few years, scores of big
OL,7,Ffirms have left the London market, are
OL,8,Fconsidering a move or have been bought
OL,9,Fby private foreign investors.
OL,11,FThe fear is this weakens the UK economy
OL,12,Fby reducing tax revenues and depressing
OL,13,Fbusiness valuations.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
